sequenceDiagram
    participant Runtime as Session Runtime
    participant KB as Knowledge Base
    participant StateBuilder as State Builder
    participant Policy as Decision Policy
    participant Catalog as Action Catalog
    participant CmdBuilder as Command Builder
    participant Executor as Command Executor
    participant Tool as External Tool
    participant Parser as Parser / Event Builder
    participant Updater as KB Updater
    participant Logger as Session Logger

    Runtime->>KB: Load current KB
    Runtime->>StateBuilder: build_state(KB)
    StateBuilder-->>Runtime: state_t

    Runtime->>Policy: decide_action(state_t)
    Policy-->>Runtime: action_id

    Runtime->>Catalog: get_action(action_id)
    Catalog-->>Runtime: action metadata

    Runtime->>CmdBuilder: build_command(action_id, KB, context)
    CmdBuilder-->>Runtime: resolved command

    Runtime->>Executor: execute(command)
    Executor->>Tool: run external tool
    Tool-->>Executor: stdout, stderr, returncode
    Executor-->>Runtime: command_result

    Runtime->>Parser: parse(action_id, command_result)
    Parser-->>Runtime: normalized events

    Runtime->>Updater: update_kb(KB, events)
    Updater-->>Runtime: KB_t+1

    Runtime->>Logger: log state, action, command, result, events
    Runtime->>Runtime: check goal / stop condition